# Only what the build needs goes into the image's build context: never local data, settings or secrets, at any depth.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.playwright
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
**/.data
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.env*
!deploy/.env.example
**/.vercel
**/.turbo
**/.DS_Store
docs
